---
// v2 architecture, laid out as a clean left-to-right pipeline with no crossing edges:
//   clients → gateway → ingress+seq → [SPSC] → engine → [SPMC] → projection → egress → clients
// The journal tees off ingress downward on an independent branch that never gates the engine;
// market-data is a separate 20Hz consumer of the SPMC broadcast.
// Vertical order is chosen so the delivery path (engine→projection→egress→clients) and the
// journal tee never overlap. The journal is asynchronous: the diagram shows the final
// design, after removing an earlier fsync-before-admission bug described in part two.
const W = 640, H = 320;
const colClients = 58;
const colTasks = 214;
const colEngine = 388;
const colOut = 566;
const bw = 116, bwEng = 120, bwSm = 104;
const rowH = 40;
// left task column, top to bottom: gateway, ingress+seq (the engine feed), journal (WAL) tee,
// egress (the delivery return). Stacking journal above egress keeps the tee and the return
// path from crossing.
const gatewayY = 40, ingressY = 108, jY = 176, egressY = 250;
const jH = 38;
const engineY = 94, engineH = 64;
const engineCy = engineY + engineH / 2;
// right output column: market-data (top) and projection (below it, feeds egress)
const mdY = 88, projY = 148;
---
<figure class="chart">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="v2 topology. WebSocket clients submit through gateway and ingress. Ingress sequences commands, then sends them independently to the engine over an SPSC ring and to the journal. The single engine thread is the only writer of market state. It publishes events over an SPMC ring to projection and a 20 Hz market-data feed; projection routes client events through egress.">
    <defs>
      <marker id="nt-arr" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="6.5" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L6.5,3 L0,6 Z" fill="var(--muted)" /></marker>
      <marker id="nt-arr-acc" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="6.5" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L6.5,3 L0,6 Z" fill="var(--accent)" /></marker>
    </defs>

    {/* clients box spans ingress↔egress so the submit and deliver arrows attach at the right heights */}
    <rect x={colClients - bw / 2} y={ingressY} width={bw} height={egressY + rowH - ingressY} rx="6" fill="var(--bg-soft)" stroke="var(--border)" />
    <text x={colClients} y={(ingressY + egressY + rowH) / 2 - 3} text-anchor="middle" class="btitle">clients</text>
    <text x={colClients} y={(ingressY + egressY + rowH) / 2 + 13} text-anchor="middle" class="bsub">WebSocket</text>

    {/* left task column */}
    <text x={colTasks} y={gatewayY - 12} text-anchor="middle" class="colttl">tokio tasks</text>
    <rect x={colTasks - bw / 2} y={gatewayY} width={bw} height={rowH} rx="6" fill="var(--bg-soft)" stroke="var(--border)" />
    <text x={colTasks} y={gatewayY + rowH / 2 + 4} text-anchor="middle" class="btask">gateway</text>
    <rect x={colTasks - bw / 2} y={ingressY} width={bw} height={rowH} rx="6" fill="var(--bg-soft)" stroke="var(--border)" />
    <text x={colTasks} y={ingressY + rowH / 2 + 4} text-anchor="middle" class="btask">ingress + seq</text>

    {/* clients → ingress (submit) */}
    <line x1={colClients + bw / 2} y1={ingressY + rowH / 2} x2={colTasks - bw / 2 - 3} y2={ingressY + rowH / 2} stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#nt-arr)" />

    {/* engine thread */}
    <rect x={colEngine - bwEng / 2} y={engineY} width={bwEng} height={engineH} rx="6" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x={colEngine} y={engineCy - 6} text-anchor="middle" class="btitle acc">engine thread</text>
    <text x={colEngine} y={engineCy + 10} text-anchor="middle" class="bsub acc">one writer · no locks</text>

    {/* ingress → SPSC → engine */}
    <line x1={colTasks + bw / 2} y1={ingressY + rowH / 2} x2={colEngine - bwEng / 2 - 3} y2={engineCy} stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#nt-arr-acc)" />
    <text x={(colTasks + bw / 2 + colEngine - bwEng / 2) / 2} y={engineY - 6} text-anchor="middle" class="ring">SPSC →</text>

    {/* engine → SPMC → projection + market-data */}
    <line x1={colEngine + bwEng / 2} y1={engineCy} x2={colOut - bwSm / 2 - 3} y2={projY + rowH / 2} stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#nt-arr-acc)" />
    <line x1={colEngine + bwEng / 2} y1={engineCy} x2={colOut - bwSm / 2 - 3} y2={mdY + rowH / 2} stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#nt-arr-acc)" />
    <text x={(colEngine + bwEng / 2 + colOut - bwSm / 2) / 2} y={engineY - 6} text-anchor="middle" class="ring">SPMC →</text>

    {/* right output column: projection (top), market-data (below) */}
    <rect x={colOut - bwSm / 2} y={projY} width={bwSm} height={rowH} rx="6" fill="var(--bg-soft)" stroke="var(--border)" />
    <text x={colOut} y={projY + rowH / 2 + 4} text-anchor="middle" class="btask">projection</text>
    <rect x={colOut - bwSm / 2} y={mdY} width={bwSm} height={rowH} rx="6" fill="var(--bg-soft)" stroke="var(--border)" />
    <text x={colOut} y={mdY + rowH / 2 - 2} text-anchor="middle" class="btask">market-data</text>
    <text x={colOut} y={mdY + rowH / 2 + 12} text-anchor="middle" class="bsub">20 Hz</text>

    {/* projection → egress: down the right edge, across the bottom (below everything), into egress */}
    <path d={`M${colOut},${projY + rowH} C${colOut},${egressY + rowH / 2} ${colTasks + bw / 2 + 40},${egressY + rowH / 2} ${colTasks + bw / 2 + 3},${egressY + rowH / 2}`} fill="none" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#nt-arr)" />

    {/* egress → clients (deliver) */}
    <line x1={colTasks - bw / 2 - 3} y1={egressY + rowH / 2} x2={colClients + bw / 2 + 3} y2={egressY + rowH / 2} stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#nt-arr)" />

    {/* journal tees off ingress, straight down into its own box (above egress, so nothing overlaps) */}
    <line x1={colTasks} y1={ingressY + rowH} x2={colTasks} y2={jY - 2} stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="4 3" marker-end="url(#nt-arr)" />
    <rect x={colTasks - bw / 2} y={jY} width={bw} height={jH} rx="6" fill="var(--bg-soft)" stroke="var(--border)" />
    <text x={colTasks} y={jY + 16} text-anchor="middle" class="btask">journal (WAL)</text>
    <text x={colTasks} y={jY + 29} text-anchor="middle" class="bsub">independent tee</text>

    {/* egress box (below journal) */}
    <rect x={colTasks - bw / 2} y={egressY} width={bw} height={rowH} rx="6" fill="var(--bg-soft)" stroke="var(--border)" />
    <text x={colTasks} y={egressY + rowH / 2 + 4} text-anchor="middle" class="btask">egress</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Clients submit through the gateway and ingress. Ingress sequences commands, sends them over an SPSC ring to the single engine thread, and tees them independently to the journal. The engine broadcasts over an SPMC ring to projection and a 20 Hz market-data feed; projection routes client-specific events back through egress. The journal is off the matching path, so a slow disk cannot delay order admission.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .chart :global(.btitle) { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--fg); font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; }
  .chart :global(.btitle.acc) { fill: var(--accent); }
  .chart :global(.btask) { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--fg); font-family: var(--font-sans); }
  .chart :global(.bsub) { font-size: 10px; fill: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font-sans); }
  .chart :global(.bsub.acc) { fill: var(--accent); }
  .chart :global(.colttl) { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--muted); font-family: var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .chart :global(.ring) { font-size: 10.5px; fill: var(--accent); font-family: var(--font-mono); }
</style>
